OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 9, dies in two-vehicle crash
OL,4,Ain the Highlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Scotland News understands the
OL,7,Ffamily are from France. The road was
OL,8,Fclosed for seven hours to allow for an
OL,9,Finvestigation.
